{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep below, in a darkened, rusting world. Humanity has been forgotten. Progress without progress. Those who should have preserved life destroyed it, and what remains is a hideous diversion from the human form. Rusted pipes. Twisted wires. Menacing liquids bubble through the bodies of those who remain. They\u2019ve forgotten the meaning of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you\u2019ve awakened, and the life in you draws them near. You must make your way through this industrial nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is your <i>Rusted Awakening.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/BRUTAL.png?t=1744806908\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/Movie_065-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1744806908\" />Weapons hit hard. Movement keeps you alive. Every shot matters. Every encounter is  brutal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/INJEKT.png?t=1744806908\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/0118-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1744806908\" />Desperate measures must be taken. A powerful injection system lets you augment your abilities on the fly, but at what cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/DARK.png?t=1744806908\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/Movie_071-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1744806908\" />Face dark horrors born of progress: suicidal, drug-forged monstrosities and the remnants of failed experiments that should never have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/SURREAL.png?t=1744806908\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/Movie_038-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1744806908\" />The world bends and warps with each step. Walls shift, corridors collapse, and reality itself distorts as the nightmare unfolds. Every step forward may be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874490?t=1744806908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744806908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744806908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744806908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains horror, violence, and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep below, in a darkened, rusting world. Humanity has been forgotten. Progress without progress. Those who should have preserved life destroyed it, and what remains is a hideous diversion from the human form. Rusted pipes. Twisted wires. Menacing liquids bubble through the bodies of those who remain. They\u2019ve forgotten the meaning of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you\u2019ve awakened, and the life in you draws